1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,220
This is Episode 31.

3
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:10,718
Maya wants her lemonade stand today.

4
00:00:10,718 --> 00:00:13,351
She hammers one board.

5
00:00:13,351 --> 00:00:15,159
Then another.

6
00:00:15,159 --> 00:00:17,433
It takes forever.

7
00:00:17,433 --> 00:00:20,771
The door is not joined to the window.

8
00:00:20,771 --> 00:00:23,005
Nothing works yet.

9
00:00:23,005 --> 00:00:24,601
Oh no!

10
00:00:24,601 --> 00:00:27,087
Here comes the booth kit.

11
00:00:27,087 --> 00:00:28,856
One pop!

12
00:00:28,856 --> 00:00:33,643
The street, the door, and the window unfold together.

13
00:00:33,643 --> 00:00:35,704
Already joined.

14
00:00:35,704 --> 00:00:37,632
Already ready.

15
00:00:37,632 --> 00:00:40,385
Maya draws a new picture.

16
00:00:40,385 --> 00:00:44,228
The kit sends it to every stand in town.

17
00:00:44,228 --> 00:00:46,170
No hammering.

18
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:47,978
No waiting.

19
00:00:47,978 --> 00:00:52,606
Build the front once, and it pops up for everyone.

20
00:00:52,606 --> 00:00:55,226
Now you know Amplify!

21
00:00:55,226 --> 00:00:59,920
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

